# Cerberus runtime directory for the API service. dh_installtmpfiles installs
# this to /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/cerberus-api.conf and invokes systemd-tmpfiles from
# the postinst (after systemd-sysusers, so the cerberus user exists). The API
# service declares ReadWritePaths=/var/log/cerberus, so it must exist first.
#Type Path               Mode UID      GID      Age Argument
d     /var/log/cerberus  0750 cerberus cerberus -
